  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>VICTORY THROUGH SUPERIOR VOLUME!</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Charisma 15, character level 5, Intimidate 5 ranks, Personal Theme Song</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> While your personal theme song ability is active, all enemies able to hear your music must make a Will save (DC 10 +½ character level + your Charisma modifier) or become shaken for a number of rounds equal to your Charisma modifier. This is a sonic, mindaffecting, fear effect.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gonzo-feats#toc37\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
